{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S06、S13等段的感受提示仍然偏密，部分近义描述连续出现，快速扫读不如X右侧短词来得直接。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把叙事拆成短句，并突出每段的关键转折，观众更容易在听音乐时抓住人物当下的处境和心理变化；感受又按音乐进程分时出现，减少了同时阅读的负担。尤其从委屈、怀念、孤单、动摇到接纳并继续生活，人物为什么这样想、前后如何变化，在Y里更容易连成一件事。X的两栏结构虽然直观，但右侧短词经常堆在一起，尤其短时段里不容易辨认哪些感受对应哪个心理变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8c7523ba-f84d-4a72-b621-2bdca379befe", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T163117102234Z", "elapsed_seconds": 42.609, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:31:59.736480+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6520ffec9672291da4c29725cd3ae555c13a500009c23e325b59754eb67e435f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py